{"seq":2,"slug":"biomaterials-bioplastics","title":"生物材料与生物塑料","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/industrial-applications/biomaterials-bioplastics","wordCount":1605,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"生物材料与生物塑料\">生物材料与生物塑料</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>全球每年生产约4亿吨塑料，其中超过90%来自石化原料且难以降解，造成严重的环境污染。生物塑料（Bioplastics）——由生物基原料制造且/或可生物降解的高分子材料——正成为循环经济转型的关键载体。生物制造为这些材料的生产提供了从碳源到聚合物的完整绿色路线。</p>\n<h3 id=\"pha生物合成\">PHA生物合成</h3><p>聚羟基脂肪酸酯（Polyhydroxyalkanoates，PHA）是微生物在碳氮比失衡条件下作为胞内碳源储备合成的天然聚酯：</p>\n<p><strong>合成途径</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>乙酰CoA</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mpadded></mover><mtext>乙酰乙酰CoA</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mpadded></mover><mtext>(R)-3-HB-CoA</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mpadded></mover><mtext>PHB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{乙酰CoA} \\xrightarrow{phaA} \\text{乙酰乙酰CoA} \\xrightarrow{phaB} \\text{(R)-3-HB-CoA} \\xrightarrow{phaC} \\text{PHB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1191em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">乙酰</span><span class=\"mord\">CoA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1191em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">乙酰乙酰</span><span class=\"mord\">CoA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3581em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(R)-3-HB-CoA</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">PHB</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中PHA合酶（PhaC）是决定聚合物链长与单体组成的关键酶。</p>\n<p><strong>PHA家族</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PHB</strong>（聚3-羟基丁酸酯）：最简单的PHA，性质类似聚丙烯但较脆</li>\n<li><strong>PHBV</strong>（掺入3-羟基戊酸单体）：降低结晶度，改善柔韧性</li>\n<li><strong>mcl-PHA</strong>（中链PHA，C6-C14）：弹性体，适合作薄膜与涂层</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>工业生产挑战</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>碳源成本占总成本60-70%——需开发廉价碳源（废油脂、合成气）</li>\n<li>细胞密度与PHA含量的权衡：目标&gt;100 g/L细胞密度、&gt;80% PHA/CDW</li>\n<li>提取工艺：溶剂法（氯仿）环保性差→超临界CO₂提取或酶解细胞壁法</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>前沿菌株工程</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>嗜盐菌<em>Halomonas</em>：在高盐非灭菌条件下发酵，省去灭菌成本</li>\n<li>2026年北京化工大学陈国强团队报道嗜盐菌连续发酵PHA，成本降至<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Unexpected character: &#x27;\\&#x27; at position 5: \\sim\\̲\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">\\sim\\</span></span>2.5/kg$</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"pla生物合成与聚合\">PLA生物合成与聚合</h3><p>聚乳酸（Polylactic Acid，PLA）是当前产量最大的生物基塑料（全球年产约50万吨）：</p>\n<p><strong>路线</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>发酵生产L-乳酸（光学纯度&gt;99.5%，使用工程化乳杆菌或大肠杆菌）</li>\n<li>乳酸→丙交酯（环状二聚体）→开环聚合（ROP）得到高分子量PLA</li>\n</ol>\n<p>关键参数——分子量与热性能的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>170</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>50</mn><mtext> kDa时</mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>170</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_m \\approx 170°C - \\frac{K}{M_n} \\quad (M_n &gt; 50\\ \\text{kDa时} T_m \\approx 170°C)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">170°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">kDa</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">时</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">170°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>PLA改性策略</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>与PBAT共混：提升韧性与断裂伸长率</li>\n<li>立构复合（Stereocomplex）：PLLA/PDLA共混，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>提升至230°C</li>\n<li>纳米填充：纤维素纳米晶（CNC）增强力学性能</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"蛋白质基材料\">蛋白质基材料</h3><p>蛋白质作为天然高分子具有生物可降解性、可调功能性与可再生性：</p>\n<p><strong>蜘蛛丝蛋白</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>强度接近钢材（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>G</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma \\approx 1.1\\ GPa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.1</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">GP</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>），韧性超越kevlar</li>\n<li>重组表达：在大肠杆菌/酵母中表达spidroin基因，通过纺丝工艺成纤</li>\n<li>Bolt Threads、Spiber等公司已实现吨级生产</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>胶原蛋白</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>工程化酵母/植物生产重组人源胶原蛋白</li>\n<li>应用：医用组织支架、化妆品原料、食品明胶替代</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>弹性蛋白（Resilin/ELP）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>弹性蛋白样多肽（ELP）在温度响应下自组装为水凝胶</li>\n<li>生物3D打印墨水、药物缓释载体</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"生物纺织品\">生物纺织品</h3><p>传统纺织业依赖石化原料（聚酯、尼龙）或高耗水农业（棉花）。生物制造开启第三条路线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>微生物纤维素（Bacterial Cellulose，BC）</strong>：<em>Komagataeibacter</em>产出高纯度纳米纤维素，无需木浆加工</li>\n<li><strong>菌丝体皮革（Mycelium Leather）</strong>：真菌菌丝体生长为皮革状片材——Bolt Threads的&quot;Mylo&quot;已用于Adidas/Stella McCartney产品</li>\n<li><strong>精密发酵丝蛋白</strong>：替代动物蚕丝，Spiber的&quot;Brewed Protein&quot;与North Face合作推出环保外套</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;碳源(葡萄糖/废弃物)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;微生物发酵&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;PHA/PLA单体&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;蛋白质纤维&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;菌丝体材料&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;生物塑料制品&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;高性能纺织品&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; H[&quot;皮革替代品&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"碳源(葡萄糖/废弃物)\"] --&gt; B[\"微生物发酵\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"PHA/PLA单体\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"蛋白质纤维\"]\n    B --&gt; E[\"菌丝体材料\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"生物塑料制品\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"高性能纺织品\"]\n    E --&gt; H[\"皮革替代品\"]</pre><h3 id=\"可降解包装与循环生物经济\">可降解包装与循环生物经济</h3><p><strong>材料设计原则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用期性能：阻隔性（O₂/H₂O通过率）、力学强度、透明度</li>\n<li>末端处理：工业堆肥（58°C，90天降解&gt;90%）或家庭堆肥兼容</li>\n<li>可追溯性：数字水印标记实现智能分类回收</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>市场与政策驱动</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>欧盟SUP指令（一次性塑料指令）2025年扩展范围，2026年覆盖外卖包装</li>\n<li>中国&quot;禁塑令&quot;持续升级——可降解塑料年需求预计2027年达500万吨</li>\n<li>EPR（生产者延伸责任）制度使石化塑料承担回收成本，拉平与生物塑料价差</li>\n</ul>\n<p>循环生物经济模型：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>碳循环效率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>进入循环的生物碳</mtext><mtext>总投入碳</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{碳循环效率} = \\frac{\\text{进入循环的生物碳}}{\\text{总投入碳}} \\times 100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">碳循环效率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">总投入碳</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">进入循环的生物碳</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>目标：从当前~20%提升至&gt;60%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026年生物材料与生物塑料关键进展：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>NatureWorks扩建美国PLA产能至15万吨/年，使用玉米废料（秸秆水解糖）替代食品级玉米淀粉</li>\n<li>蓝晶微生物（中国）实现PHA成本突破——嗜盐菌+餐厨废油路线，报价降至$3/kg（接近PBAT成本线）</li>\n<li>Spiber日本工厂投产：年产数百吨重组结构蛋白，用于The North Face联名款运动外套</li>\n<li>欧洲新标准EN 17427发布：首个专门针对家庭可堆肥塑料的认证体系</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>PHA的生产成本约<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>g</mi><mtext>，而石化</mtext><mi>P</mi><mi>E</mi><mtext>约</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4-6/kg，而石化PE约</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，而石化</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">约</span></span></span></span></span>1-1.5/kg。从碳源成本、发酵效率和下游提取三个环节分析PHA降本的关键突破方向。</li>\n<li>PLA的熔点（~170°C）限制了其在热饮杯等场景的应用。列举至少两种提升PLA耐热性的策略并分析各自的可行性。</li>\n<li>蜘蛛丝蛋白的重组表达面临什么独特挑战？（提示：考虑基因重复序列、分子量、分泌效率）</li>\n<li>&quot;可生物降解&quot;是否等于&quot;环保&quot;？分析在什么情况下可降解塑料可能带来新的环境问题。</li>\n<li>设计一个以餐厨废弃物为碳源生产PHA的完整工艺流程（从原料处理到最终产品）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>生物材料与生物塑料是循环经济转型的核心载体。PHA与PLA分别代表&quot;全程生物&quot;与&quot;生物单体+化学聚合&quot;两种技术范式，各有成本结构与性能特点。蛋白质基材料（蜘蛛丝、胶原蛋白）开启了高性能纤维的新时代，而菌丝体材料正在颠覆传统皮革与纺织产业。政策驱动（禁塑令、碳税、EPR）正在根本性改变生物塑料的经济学，使其从&quot;环保溢价产品&quot;向&quot;主流工程材料&quot;转型。生物制造为实现&quot;从生物质来、回生物圈去&quot;的碳循环闭环提供了技术基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生物材料与生物塑料","id":"生物材料与生物塑料"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"PHA生物合成","id":"pha生物合成"},{"level":3,"text":"PLA生物合成与聚合","id":"pla生物合成与聚合"},{"level":3,"text":"蛋白质基材料","id":"蛋白质基材料"},{"level":3,"text":"生物纺织品","id":"生物纺织品"},{"level":3,"text":"可降解包装与循环生物经济","id":"可降解包装与循环生物经济"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"生物燃料与化学品","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/industrial-applications/biofuels-biochemicals"},"next":{"title":"生物医药与食品制造","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/industrial-applications/biopharmaceuticals-food"}}